ed, Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":112},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":172},{"title":"DocumentVersionService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentVersionServiceBothAPI.md","line":199},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":205},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":238},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":272},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":307},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":363},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":396},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":458},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":519},{"title":"DocumentService API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DocumentServiceBothAPI.md","line":580}],"metadata":{"title":"SystemDocument - Scoped, Global","description":"The SystemDocument API provides methods for setting fields of a record in the Documents \\[ds\\_document\\] table.Instantiates a SystemDocument object.Sets the Audience field of a document record to specify external or internal availability. Represents the Audience field in a Document Management form.Sets the Classification field of a document record to identify the level of information sensitivity. Represents the Classification field in a Document Management form.Sets the template from which to generate a document. When the document is generated, the specified template is listed in the Created From Template field in the Documents \\[ds\\_document\\_list\\] table.Sets the Department field of a document record.Sets the Description field of a document record.Sets the Name field of a document record.Sets the Owner field of a document record.Sets the Reviewers field of a document record.Sets the State field of a document record.Specifies whether a document record is a template.Sets the Type field of a document record.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/SystemDocumentBothAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":7,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[46,62],[66,72],[114,121],[125,131],[174,